# STIG CD16-00-006000: PostgreSQL Client Error Messages
# STIG ID: V-261908 (MEDIUM) - Error messages must not reveal exploitable info
# Check: psql -c "SHOW client_min_messages" -> must be "error"
# Finding: client_min_messages is not set to error

META
    esp_id `pg16-cd16-00-006000-client-min-messages-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `pg16`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG CD16-00-006000: PostgreSQL Client Error Messages`
    description `Validates that PostgreSQL limits error message detail exposed to clients by setting client_min_messages to error. Verbose messages such as debug or notice levels can reveal internal schema details, query structure, and file paths that adversaries can exploit.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `pg16,stig,error-messages,si-11,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:CD16-00-006000,NIST-800-53:SI-11`
    control_objective `SI-11`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `dba`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `PostgreSQL16:localhost:pg-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Set client_min_messages to error in postgresql.conf or via ALTER SYSTEM, then reload the PostgreSQL service.`

    component_id `comp-pg16-db`

    impl_SI_11 `PostgreSQL implements secure error handling by restricting the verbosity of client-facing error messages to the error level. The client_min_messages parameter is validated to confirm that debug, log, notice, and warning messages are suppressed from client output. This prevents disclosure of internal schema details, query structure, file paths, and stack traces that could be exploited by adversaries to map the database attack surface.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT pg_client_messages
        parameter `client_min_messages`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE messages_restricted
        found boolean = true
        value string = `error`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN pg_config_param
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF messages_restricted
            OBJECT_REF pg_client_messages
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
